{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cairn: Mathair\u2019s Curse is a heartfelt, Scottish turn-based story driven JRPG about a boy and his mother, in an adventure that explores loss and family.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.poster.avif?t=1758404672\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.webm?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.mp4?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2800 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25-30 hour single-player JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-rich narrative steeped in Celtic mythology and Scottish culture</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky turned-based combat with cultists, Haggis and stop-signs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock areas, find presents and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/1e1ce151189c9c1ee692e5c107e45abf.poster.avif?t=1758404672\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/1e1ce151189c9c1ee692e5c107e45abf.webm?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/1e1ce151189c9c1ee692e5c107e45abf.mp4?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted locations, from quaint seaside villages to ancient underground caverns and secret high-tech lairs. The world of Cairn: Mathair's Curse is inspired by life in the Scottish Highlands in the early 2000s. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/915e30362e9355e9d5e72b26875cff0e.poster.avif?t=1758404672\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/915e30362e9355e9d5e72b26875cff0e.webm?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/915e30362e9355e9d5e72b26875cff0e.mp4?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unusual and wacky enemies, including wild roaming haggis', bewildered stop signs and an odd group of cultists bent on destroying the world. Use character unique skills to tip the balance and unleash devastation on your foes and combine the skills of your friends to tactically defeat your enemies. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/8443e7dc1257763be3f6f43c63882cb9.poster.avif?t=1758404672\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/8443e7dc1257763be3f6f43c63882cb9.webm?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/8443e7dc1257763be3f6f43c63882cb9.mp4?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack hand-crafted for the world of Cairn: Mathair's Curse - from bouncing combat music to spooky exploration ambience and heart-breaking melodies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1302530?t=1758404672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/45d91c94bb1f173caeb4acbbfe8d2e546afbbdaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758404672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/01a48cc8fd0a2a8d9da278b8fcb24ca864242ccd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758404672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/01a48cc8fd0a2a8d9da278b8fcb24ca864242ccd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758404672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cairn: Mathair\u2019s Curse is a heartfelt, Scottish turn-based story driven JRPG about a boy and his mother, in an adventure that explores loss and family.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.poster.avif?t=1758404672\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.webm?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/836986af968d79910a507f4435c17b14.mp4?t=1758404672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa